  "limitations": [
    "Ten claimants are serialized in a fixed-ledger local host, in native and WASM execution. This does not simulate ten simultaneous network submissions or establish fairness.",
    "Free reservation/no-show and allocation-policy changes remain open. No deposit, slashing, reopening, batch selection or eligibility protocol was added.",
    "Build warnings: large Three.js chunk advisory and deprecated Node Buffer usage. Passing checks do not imply dependency alerts are resolved.",
    "The first-run native-link fixture failure JSON explicitly reconstructs recorded console output; it is not an original raw report. Interrupted and runtime-failure artifacts are retained as failures, not passing evidence.",
    "Initial unverified screenshots from a stale preview are excluded. Final current preview was assembled from final successful landing and app production builds.",
    "Not a full repository audit, independent cryptographic audit, mainnet safety guarantee or live deployment. The private profile was not revalidated; V3 writes remain incompatible with the old configured kernel."
  ]
